Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:08.30,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(637.273,334.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,1100,6525,7380)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:08.30,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(637.273,511.363)\fade(255,0,255,0,1100,6525,7380)}Battle of Wancheng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings your esteemed presence here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.637,381.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1850,2200)}Chén Guī
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General, I heard your death is soon coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to give my condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.091,463.637)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1200,1500)}Lü Bù\NStyled- Fèngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you speak thus?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I am only saying, my lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long ago, when Lord Yuán sent you gold, silk, and fine rice,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,his true purpose was to bribe you to eliminate Liú Xuándé!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, sir, shot an arrow through your\Nhalberd to shut the issue down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now today, he has come to propose a marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Intending to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.27,0:01:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He intends to take your daughter hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, he will come to attack Liú Bèi\Nand snatch Xiǎopèi from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If Xiǎopèi falls, then Xú province will...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Be in peril?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We would be done for...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is the strategy of "isolating a family."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Isolating a family"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, Yuán Shù may come to ask for grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,or he will ask us for troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he will surely exhaust your supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to decline,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,there will be strife amongst your "family."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.90,0:02:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be abandoning your\Nrelatives and inviting hostilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I was told that Yuán Shù\Nhad intentions to declare himself emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an act of insurrection!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ally with him and he rebels,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then you, General, will be the relative of a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How could the world tolerate you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chén Gōng misled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Get Zhāng Liáo after them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I must get my daughter {\i1}back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhāng! You must return my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Fēi, you thief!\NLeave the horses you've stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the horses we bought were stolen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?! The audacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out he is Liú Bèi's brother, Zhāng Fēi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Large-eyed brute!\NHe's terrorized me too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Muster the troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Fēi, I will fight you, and then we shall see who's superior and who's inferior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(929.091,470.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,540,1455,1740)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother, why did you lead your troops here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot an arrow through my halberd, saving you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but now you steal my horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we needed horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent people to purchase them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ever steal your horses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You ordered your brother Zhāng Fēi to turn bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Half my horses from Shāndōng are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare deny this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(959.091,463.637)\fade(255,0,255,0,415,2000,2340)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.27,0:05:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole your horses! \NWhat're you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Large-eyed brute!\NYou dare to slight me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Getting angry over a few stolen horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What about my brother's land which you stole?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Sound the retreat signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have returned all of the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:51.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(342.727,516.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,5050,5340)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But that Lü Bù...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard of three fathers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.90,0:05:57.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.273,474.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1650,1980)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:06:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, Xiǎopèi can only last so long from Lü Bù's assaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo despises Lü Bù the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lü Bù refuses to withdraw even after sire has seen to the horses' return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As I see it, it would be better to abandon Xiǎopèi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,go to Xǔdū, and seek shelter under Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We could ask for troops \Nand defeat Lü Bù later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why need aid from Cáo Cāo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, I'm not scared of that Lü Bù!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You! You always end up causing trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, we told you to stop drinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, are you against me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't wine, it's water!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,First it's Lü Bù, now we kneel to Cáo Cāo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be able to endure it, but I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'll lead the vanguard and break the siege?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The sin is mine. I will give my life to get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We all know that you are a just and frank man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and that you hate erratic and\Ndishonest people like Lü Bù.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I feel the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But when a true man acts in troubled times,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,they must be open-minded and upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In the face of adversity, we must bow to others and wait for the right time to rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't oppose our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.51,0:08:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At the third watch, we'll break out from the northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé, be the vanguard; Yúncháng, guard the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sūn Qián, Mí Zhú, and I will be in the middle,\Nprotecting our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall obey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(299.091,469.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1135,1420)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Lord Xuándé, I assume\Nyou've been well since we last met?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come to seek shelter.\NI'm ashamed to ask it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what are you saying, Xuándé?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lü Bù is one of the most wicked men. \NHe won't achieve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I ought to punish him alongside you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's banquet will help ease\Nyour pain from losing your land!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, Liú Bèi is one of \Nmany ambitious men in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If we don't eliminate him now, he will become a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Wénruò, you conceived the ideas of "two tigers competing for food"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and "driving the tiger to devour the wolf."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}All this effort, wasn't it all because of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now this tiger was defeated and has come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.39,0:09:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, you only need one phrase to eliminate Liú Bèi;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}why even plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Fèngxiào!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fèngxiào, Xún Yù advised me to kill Xuándé.\NWhat do you think about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Liú Bèi is ambitious too.\NIf he lives, isn't he going to stir trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, your army has a righteous cause to rid all ills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Only your integrity will lure prodigies;\Nthe lack thereof will repel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Xuándé has made quite a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now he has come to you in great peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To kill him would be as if \Nto do harm upon a virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.59,0:10:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Talents across the realm will be fearful\Nand will hesitate to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Who else would you rely on\Nto pacify the realm then, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You can eliminate one \Npotentially dangerous person,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but dash the hopes of all within the four seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, you can't be too rash;\Nyou must consider it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, your words are like my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I was only speaking in jest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Very well. I will make a statement to the court tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to recommend Liú Bèi \Nas {\i1}Potentate of Yù Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, do not do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, you mustn't promote Liú Bèi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Liú Bèi is a champion of the times,\Nnot content to be a subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Giving him land \Nwould be like caring for a tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In the end, he won't stand for serving under other men;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}better to get rid of him forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This tiger cannot be left alone,\Nyet cannot be eliminated either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.91,0:11:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is an era where having heroes is essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I can't lose the hearts of the people just because I want to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Guō Fèngxiào's belief is the same I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Say no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:04.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 2nd year of the Jiàn'ān era\Nunder Emperor Xiàn,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:09.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,while Cáo Cāo joined forces\Nwith Liú Bèi to invade Lü Bù,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:13.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Xiù, with Liú Biǎo,\Nstationed troops at the City of Wǎn,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,wanting to attack Cáo Cāo and seize power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:20.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,On one side, Cáo Cāo attacked Lü Bù;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:25.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,on the other, he led a grand army through three different roads to punish Zhāng Xiù.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Xiàhóu Dūn, vanguard of Cáo Cāo's army,\Nhas set up camp at Yùshuǐ!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Scout again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:50.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(950.909,492.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,540,1485,1740)}Jiǎ Xǔ\NStyled: Wénhé
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:54.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(282.727,399.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,535,1735,2100)}Zhāng Xiù
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo is a capable commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:13:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All civil officials and generals\Nunder his banner are experts in warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's leading 150,000 troops divided in three from three different directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a testament to his might.\NWe can't possibly face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Wénhé,\Nwhat do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With your uncle dead and the\Ninsufficiency of Liú Biǎo's army,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,in my modest opinion... the best course of action...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we might as well do him a favor and just surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you are saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,is that it would be better to be under Cáo Cāo's banner
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,with my eyes down as {\i1}a defeated enemy general?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That... this is a matter of time and might! A matter of time and might!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A matter of time and might?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Receive the official seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way for my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:31.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(299.091,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,575,1100,1380)}Diǎn Wéi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any {\i1}"mistresses" {\i0}within this city?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Last night, through the side of the chambers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I saw a married woman, who looked very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After asking, they told me she was the wife of Zhāng Jì.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A very beautiful woman...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Zhāng Jì is the uncle of Zhāng Xiù.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, as he's recently\Nleft this world, I'm afraid—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Zhāng Xiù?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a lout who lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if he gets mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gives him the right to complain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Take fifty armed men and bring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,May I dare ask for your name, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the wife of Zhāng Jì, Lady Zōu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, have you've heard of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.55,0:20:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've long heard of your name, General.\NI am fortunate to meet you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was for you that I allowed\NZhāng Xiù to surrender and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise the Zhāng clan\Nwould have been exterminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful, for I owe my\Nvery life to your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To finally meet you today, ma'am, is Heaven's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, are you willing\Nto share a bed with me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Being looked after by you, General, is the blessing of three lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you stay in the city for too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.79,0:21:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Xiù will have suspicions, and\NI fear outsiders will begin to gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommorow, you will go with me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and dwell in my camp outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I willing to suffer such a big disgrace?\NThis won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.91,0:22:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He kidnapped my aunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.02,0:22:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I {\i1}stay calm!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.99,0:22:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cáo Cāo flees the city, he will camp outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.11,0:22:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's his valiant general, Diǎn Wéi,\Nwho acts as his bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.62,0:22:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else may enter unless stated otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By restricting access from outside or inside,\Nthey can be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you act rashly, the consequences\Nwill be extremely disastrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.23,0:22:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For this matter... you must heed my advice. \NMake sure you tell no one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the following days, that\Nbastard will come out to discuss matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs27.273\}You need to do it like {\i1}this,{\i0} in {\i1}that{\i0} way...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.58,0:23:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General, why have you called me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hú Chē'er.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.91,0:23:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Cáo Cāo called his\Nofficers to a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.70,0:23:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I ordered many of my soldiers\Nto desert en masse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.30,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, I was able to situate in the center of his camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know my plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:50.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(912.727,549.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1900,2180)}Hú Chē'er
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.89,0:23:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.31,0:23:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.82,0:23:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Though my plan to move troops\Nhasn't made Cáo Cāo suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a man guarding the tent in the camp, Diǎn Wéi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a fearsome warrior, and getting in will be most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.99,0:24:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I summoned you to discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.19,0:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's fearsome about \NDiǎn Wéi are his twin halberds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, invite him tomorrow to have some wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Assure he gets really drunk, then have him return. Then—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what? What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.90,0:24:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sneak into the tent and steal his halberds; no need to fear him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.03,0:24:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Enact your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.11,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.75,0:24:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you sure can handle large amounts!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.79,0:24:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.78,0:24:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.95,0:25:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's late already.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get too drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.11,0:25:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very famous! It's rare to even see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once, drink as much as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.95,0:25:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I must always be by my lord to protect him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}Like a leaf in the wind, \NI now wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.46,0:26:07.18,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k99\i1}Wǒ {\k109}běn {\k94}piāo{\k115}líng {\k257}rén.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}Born under an unlucky star,\Nmy life has been bitter;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:14.18,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k69\i1}Bó{\k139}mìng {\k83}lì {\k144}kǔ{\k165}xīn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.42,0:26:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}escaping from chaos, \NI encountered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.18,0:26:23.10,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k103\i1}Lì{\k207}luàn {\k104}de {\k103}yù{\k173}jūn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}I am most grateful for\Nyour kindness when we met;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:30.98,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k103\i1}Gǎn {\k68}jūn {\k84}píng{\k123}shuǐ {\k362}ēn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}your love brings \Nbut temporary happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.58,0:26:38.18,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k83\i1}Jūn {\k176}ài {\k109}yī{\k70}shì {\k162}huān.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}The beacon signals \Nan auspicious occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:45.50,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k74\i1}fēng{\k74}yān {\k83}zuò {\k93}liáng{\k306}chén.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.86,0:26:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}With tears in my \Neyes for your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.58,0:26:53.18,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k122\i1}Hán{\k186}leì {\k89}wéi {\k84}jūn {\k119}shòu,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.72,0:27:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}wine conceals the scars of warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.18,0:27:00.18,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k41\i1}Jiǔ{\k120}hén {\k104}yǎn {\k89}zhēng{\k246}chén
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.30,0:27:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}Dim, so dim is the lamplight;
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.58,0:27:07.70,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k233\i1}Dēng {\k98}hūn {\k279}hūn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.00,0:27:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}deep, so deep is this tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.42,0:27:13.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k151\i1}Zhàng {\k86}shēn{\k279}shēn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.60,0:27:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}The soft pouring of wine;
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:19.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k210\i1}Jūn {\k117}wàng{\k293}qíng
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.02,0:27:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}the soft words spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.58,0:27:24.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k105\i1}Qiè {\k105}shàng{\k240}shēn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.90,0:27:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}An instant of elation;
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.94,0:27:27.78,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k14\i1}Yī{\k26}shà {\k95}huān{\k152}xīn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)\i1}an instant of comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.98,0:27:30.10,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k28\i1}Yī{\k68}shà {\k67}wēn{\k47}xīn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.86,0:27:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}Who will understand \Nthe meaning of my verse;{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.90,0:27:34.58,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k97\i1}Míng{\k44}ri {\k53}Yù{\k41}shuǐ {\k135}tóu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.50,0:27:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}who will empathize with\N the person in this song?{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.90,0:27:51.30,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k348}{\i0}Yí {\k182}wèi {\k213}yùn {\k143}mái {\k355}xiāng {\k85}h{\k120}ú{\k194}n
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.91,0:28:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.67,0:28:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son, Cáo Áng, and nephew, Cáo Ānmín...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.59,0:28:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we found their bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.99,0:28:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But General Diǎn Wéi...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.95,0:28:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General Diǎn Wéi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.43,0:28:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.14,0:28:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Diǎn Wéi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.51,0:29:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.86,0:29:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.87,0:29:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,General Yú Jìn... he...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.67,0:29:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Yú Jìn?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.77,0:29:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yú Jìn took advantage and rebelled,\Nattacking Xiàhóu Dūn's Qingzhōu Assault Troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:18.14,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Qingzhōu Troops were an elite battalion serving under Cao Cao, formed from the remnants of the Yellow Turbans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's killed many of our men!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.99,0:29:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.42,0:29:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When Yú Jìn heard of my defeat,\Nhe did not come to rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.83,0:29:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, he took advantage and rebelled,\Nlike dropping stones on someone stuck in a well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight him with all I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.87,0:29:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.07,0:29:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yú Jìn led his troops to pursue Zhāng Xiù\Nfor more than 100 {\i1}li!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.06,0:29:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He won total victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.58,0:30:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.58,0:30:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We followed Yú Jìn, who pursued\NZhāng Xiù through several roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.58,0:30:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,His strength is exhausted, and he found himself isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.42,0:30:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The defeated troops have fled to Liú Biǎo!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.91,0:30:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.50,0:30:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yú Jìn,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.50,0:30:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,some men accused you\Nof excessive cruelty and rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.59,0:30:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, that—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.74,0:30:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.94,0:30:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Qīngzhōu Troops rebelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.31,0:30:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you tell me first \Nbut fight them yourself instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They were coming rapidly;\Nthere was no time to report it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.63,0:31:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, this affair was never General Yú Jìn's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.28,0:31:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is mine; I was too laid back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.10,0:31:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Qīngzhōu Troops began stirring trouble \Nand raided the countryside!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thereafter, Yú Jìn killed those curs,\Ncalming the people along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yú Jìn, when you saw me coming your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.59,0:31:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't explain your actions.\NInstead, you prepared for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.59,0:31:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.94,0:31:35.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(920.909,505.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2300,2620)}Yú Jìn\NStyled: Wénzé
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.60,0:31:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The rebels were on us. If we didn't prepare,\Nhow could we have fought?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.60,0:31:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't come to me to explain; did you not fear I'd wrong you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Explanations are trivial;\N defense is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.30,0:31:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.55,0:31:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, even under pressure,\Nyou were able to build a firm base.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.94,0:31:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You ignored slander and turned defeat into victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.71,0:31:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the famed generals of old...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.78,0:32:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,could hardly compare!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.70,0:32:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.59,0:32:33.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo not only lost his favorite general, Diǎn Wéi,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.82,0:32:38.10,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,but also his beloved son and nephew, Cáo Áng and Cáo Ānmín.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.10,0:32:41.98,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Luckily, Yú Jìn and others did their best to aid him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.98,0:32:46.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,allowing Cáo Cāo to turn defeat into victory and danger into safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.23,0:32:52.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 3rd year of the Jiàn'ān era,\NYuán Shù proclaimed himself Emperor in Huáinán.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:55.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When he heard of it,\NCáo Cāo led an army of 170,000 troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.78,0:32:58.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,joining forces with Sūn Cè of Jiāngdōng,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.10,0:33:00.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liú Bèi of Yù Province, and Lü Bù of Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.58,0:33:03.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to attack Yuán Shù from three directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.75,0:33:08.22,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Seeing himself surrounded by enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:13.02,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Yuán Shú was forced to sail across the Huái River,\Nbringing treasures with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.02,0:33:17.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He ordered Lǐ Fēng and others to\Ngarrison and defend Shòuchūn to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.54,0:33:25.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo was facing another enemy in a prolonged and bloody battle once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.54,0:34:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please ask for Rèn Jùn's subordinate, the supplies overseer, Wáng Hòu,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.56,0:34:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to come to my tent right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.54,0:34:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.31,0:34:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.51,0:34:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.67,0:34:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.71,0:34:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How much is left of those 400,000 {\i1}hú{\i0} of grain we borrowed from Sūn Cè?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.23,0:34:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that much left.\NThere's barely enough to feed 170,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.79,0:35:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you need to reduce the rations
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.03,0:35:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,for each soldier at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.54,0:35:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they complain, what to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.74,0:35:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have another solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.42,0:35:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, even if we reduce the rations,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only enough for three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.59,0:35:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.86,0:35:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.86,0:36:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.66,0:36:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.07,0:36:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.62,0:36:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.54,0:37:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's idea was it to reduce rations?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.70,0:37:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they taking our food?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.87,0:37:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.15,0:37:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose idea was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.02,0:37:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose idea was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.02,0:37:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.43,0:37:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.23,0:37:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.86,0:37:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord!\NLook what's happening out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.10,0:37:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The soldiers are rioting over the rations!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.02,0:37:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They're saying that you've cheated them!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.67,0:37:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.91,0:37:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord! Please do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.66,0:37:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They'll start a mutiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.43,0:38:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.06,0:38:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I thought of borrowing \Nsomething from you to calm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.27,0:38:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I hope you won't resent me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.39,0:38:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Resent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.95,0:38:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}What does Sire want to borrow from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.11,0:38:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.58,0:38:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I want to borrow your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.83,0:38:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.75,0:38:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I've done nothing wrong! How can you-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.74,0:38:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I know that you're innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.03,0:38:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}but if I don't kill you, \Nthe army will mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.15,0:38:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}After you die, your wife\Nand children shall be in my care.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.43,0:39:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You need not worry for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.15,0:39:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.71,0:39:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.83,0:39:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.42,0:39:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wáng Hòu knowingly distributed small rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.42,0:39:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The crime for withholding rations, according to military law, is...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.59,0:39:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,death!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.48,0:39:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.26,0:39:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It was him, the supplies overseer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.63,0:39:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve death!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.78,0:40:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He deserves death! Kill him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.82,0:40:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord... I bid you farewell.

